    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Experiment with Physics. Unleash Chaos. Laugh at the Results.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RMF\u2019s Ragdoll Physics Experiments</strong>\u00a0(RPX) is a sandbox of absurdity set in a <strong>barely-functional</strong> facility where you're (allegedly) in control. <strong>Build elaborate machines</strong>, trigger chain reactions, and sit back as everything goes beautifully wrong. Or test your wits in challenge rooms built to confuse, frustrate, and occasionally <strong>reward</strong> you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether, you're into hilarious ragdoll physics, creative desctructions, or just seeing what breaks first, this is for you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Love dropping heavy boulders onto ragdolls? Perfect</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build whatever you can imagine using an extensive set of props, and gadgets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/986ce1147b796cb6983a6d1cb6142fa8.poster.avif?t=1754414005\" width=800 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/986ce1147b796cb6983a6d1cb6142fa8.webm?t=1754414005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/986ce1147b796cb6983a6d1cb6142fa8.mp4?t=1754414005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or fire cannons first and ask the questions later.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/918ba00ba871dda24c4a0f4367dd3051.poster.avif?t=1754414005\" width=800 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/918ba00ba871dda24c4a0f4367dd3051.webm?t=1754414005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/918ba00ba871dda24c4a0f4367dd3051.mp4?t=1754414005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Complete Challenges. Earn Credits. Unlock More Mayhem.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit the S.A.F.E. shop and unlock new gadgets in to play with in the sandbox.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/5194fa70e66f6c176e02f7dba007fac7.poster.avif?t=1754414005\" width=800 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/5194fa70e66f6c176e02f7dba007fac7.webm?t=1754414005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/5194fa70e66f6c176e02f7dba007fac7.mp4?t=1754414005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The perfect stress hammer for when you can't find your usual squeezy balls.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Build</strong> - Place traps, launchers, and props in Setup Mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfac Get Physic(al)\u00a0</strong>- Hit GO and watch it all unfold in beautiful slow-mo glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfc6 Challenge</strong> - Complete tasks, earn stars, and unlock more gadgets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd0d Explore</strong> - Dig into hidden rooms and let the facility talk back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/a4f0fc0f72b637eeafa1565bed0c323e.poster.avif?t=1754414005\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/a4f0fc0f72b637eeafa1565bed0c323e.webm?t=1754414005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/a4f0fc0f72b637eeafa1565bed0c323e.mp4?t=1754414005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SUPER Satisfying Physics-Based Destruction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every impact, collapse, and explosion feels better (and more wholesome) than the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/b75b7745a7ef5e8109c5b3bd55a0d38e.poster.avif?t=1754414005\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/b75b7745a7ef5e8109c5b3bd55a0d38e.webm?t=1754414005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/b75b7745a7ef5e8109c5b3bd55a0d38e.mp4?t=1754414005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endless Replayability</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two experiments are ever the same. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/f42fdcc17651dd316e0c0aea848f6611.poster.avif?t=1754414005\" width=800 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/f42fdcc17651dd316e0c0aea848f6611.webm?t=1754414005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/f42fdcc17651dd316e0c0aea848f6611.mp4?t=1754414005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exploring can bring rewards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sarcastic AI watching your every move? It has a name: the Voice of the Facility. Explore and see what it\u2019s hiding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/a48810523ac1f0dc0e83087a02663641.poster.avif?t=1754414005\" width=800 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/a48810523ac1f0dc0e83087a02663641.webm?t=1754414005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/a48810523ac1f0dc0e83087a02663641.mp4?t=1754414005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How You Play in 3 simple steps</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1) Set Up Your Experiment.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2) Activate physics.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3) Enjoy the chaos.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/c3ddb1498a70351610128d2cc50294ed.poster.avif?t=1754414005\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/c3ddb1498a70351610128d2cc50294ed.webm?t=1754414005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/c3ddb1498a70351610128d2cc50294ed.mp4?t=1754414005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What You Can Do in RPX?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build elaborate chain reactions &amp; Launch ragdolls</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Work your way through the challenge rooms</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the facililty and find out the secrets</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get ready to build, destroy, and laugh harder than you ever have before!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/f15b405bbc554e9d1efdb93777b8e14f.poster.avif?t=1754414005\" width=800 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/f15b405bbc554e9d1efdb93777b8e14f.webm?t=1754414005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/f15b405bbc554e9d1efdb93777b8e14f.mp4?t=1754414005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Experiment with Physics. Unleash Chaos. Laugh at the Results.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RMF\u2019s Ragdoll Physics Experiments</strong>\u00a0(RPX) is a sandbox of absurdity set in a <strong>barely-functional</strong> facility where you're (allegedly) in control. <strong>Build elaborate machines</strong>, trigger chain reactions, and sit back as everything goes beautifully wrong. Or test your wits in challenge rooms built to confuse, frustrate, and occasionally <strong>reward</strong> you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether, you're into hilarious ragdoll physics, creative desctructions, or just seeing what breaks first, this is for you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Love dropping heavy boulders onto ragdolls? Perfect</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build whatever you can imagine using an extensive set of props, and gadgets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/986ce1147b796cb6983a6d1cb6142fa8.poster.avif?t=1754414005\" width=800 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/986ce1147b796cb6983a6d1cb6142fa8.webm?t=1754414005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/986ce1147b796cb6983a6d1cb6142fa8.mp4?t=1754414005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or fire cannons first and ask the questions later.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/918ba00ba871dda24c4a0f4367dd3051.poster.avif?t=1754414005\" width=800 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/918ba00ba871dda24c4a0f4367dd3051.webm?t=1754414005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/918ba00ba871dda24c4a0f4367dd3051.mp4?t=1754414005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Complete Challenges. Earn Credits. Unlock More Mayhem.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit the S.A.F.E. shop and unlock new gadgets in to play with in the sandbox.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/5194fa70e66f6c176e02f7dba007fac7.poster.avif?t=1754414005\" width=800 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/5194fa70e66f6c176e02f7dba007fac7.webm?t=1754414005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/5194fa70e66f6c176e02f7dba007fac7.mp4?t=1754414005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The perfect stress hammer for when you can't find your usual squeezy balls.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Build</strong> - Place traps, launchers, and props in Setup Mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfac Get Physic(al)\u00a0</strong>- Hit GO and watch it all unfold in beautiful slow-mo glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfc6 Challenge</strong> - Complete tasks, earn stars, and unlock more gadgets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd0d Explore</strong> - Dig into hidden rooms and let the facility talk back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/a4f0fc0f72b637eeafa1565bed0c323e.poster.avif?t=1754414005\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/a4f0fc0f72b637eeafa1565bed0c323e.webm?t=1754414005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/a4f0fc0f72b637eeafa1565bed0c323e.mp4?t=1754414005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SUPER Satisfying Physics-Based Destruction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every impact, collapse, and explosion feels better (and more wholesome) than the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/b75b7745a7ef5e8109c5b3bd55a0d38e.poster.avif?t=1754414005\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/b75b7745a7ef5e8109c5b3bd55a0d38e.webm?t=1754414005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/b75b7745a7ef5e8109c5b3bd55a0d38e.mp4?t=1754414005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endless Replayability</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two experiments are ever the same. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/f42fdcc17651dd316e0c0aea848f6611.poster.avif?t=1754414005\" width=800 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/f42fdcc17651dd316e0c0aea848f6611.webm?t=1754414005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/f42fdcc17651dd316e0c0aea848f6611.mp4?t=1754414005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exploring can bring rewards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sarcastic AI watching your every move? It has a name: the Voice of the Facility. Explore and see what it\u2019s hiding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/a48810523ac1f0dc0e83087a02663641.poster.avif?t=1754414005\" width=800 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/a48810523ac1f0dc0e83087a02663641.webm?t=1754414005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/a48810523ac1f0dc0e83087a02663641.mp4?t=1754414005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How You Play in 3 simple steps</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1) Set Up Your Experiment.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2) Activate physics.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3) Enjoy the chaos.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/c3ddb1498a70351610128d2cc50294ed.poster.avif?t=1754414005\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/c3ddb1498a70351610128d2cc50294ed.webm?t=1754414005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/c3ddb1498a70351610128d2cc50294ed.mp4?t=1754414005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What You Can Do in RPX?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build elaborate chain reactions &amp; Launch ragdolls</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Work your way through the challenge rooms</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the facililty and find out the secrets</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get ready to build, destroy, and laugh harder than you ever have before!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/f15b405bbc554e9d1efdb93777b8e14f.poster.avif?t=1754414005\" width=800 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/f15b405bbc554e9d1efdb93777b8e14f.webm?t=1754414005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337130/extras/f15b405bbc554e9d1efdb93777b8e14f.mp4?t=1754414005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p>",
